flowchart TD
    Core[Musoftwares Ecosystem Core]
    
    subgraph Phase1[Phase 1: Foundation & Public]
        direction TB
        Auth[Authentication Module]
        Auth1[Implement Login/Register]
        Auth2[Setup Password Recovery]
        Auth3[Develop Onboarding Wizard]
        Auth --> Auth1 --> Auth2 --> Auth3
        
        Public[Public & Marketing Pages]
        Pub1[Setup Home & Info Routes]
        Pub2[Create Legal & Company Pages]
        Pub3[Build Platform & Solution Pages]
        Pub4[Implement Blog System]
        Public --> Pub1 --> Pub2 --> Pub3 --> Pub4
    end

    subgraph Phase2[Phase 2: Management & Portals]
        direction TB
        Admin[Admin Panel]
        Adm1[Build Dashboard]
        Adm2[Setup Content & Financial Reports]
        Adm3[Create Overseers]
        Adm4[Develop Users & Transactions Mgmt]
        Adm5[Configure System Settings]
        Admin --> Adm1 --> Adm2 --> Adm3 --> Adm4 --> Adm5

        Client[Client Portal]
        Cli1[Setup Dashboard & Notifications]
        Cli2[Implement Financials & Billing]
        Cli3[Build Chat & Support Tickets]
        Cli4[Develop Settings & Profile Mgmt]
        Client --> Cli1 --> Cli2 --> Cli3 --> Cli4
    end

    subgraph Phase3[Phase 3: Core Business Modules]
        direction TB
        ERP[ERP Module]
        ERP1[Setup Dashboard & Config]
        ERP2[Implement Client Management]
        ERP3[Build Full-Page Invoices & Billing]
        ERP4[Develop Financial Control]
        ERP5[Create Inventory & POS]
        ERP6[Setup HR & Project Mgmt]
        ERP --> ERP1 --> ERP2 --> ERP3 --> ERP4 --> ERP5 --> ERP6

        CRM[CRM Module]
        CRM1[Build Role-Based Dashboards]
        CRM2[Implement Leads & Pipelines]
        CRM3[Develop Campaigns & Sequences]
        CRM4[Setup Config & Integrations]
        CRM --> CRM1 --> CRM2 --> CRM3 --> CRM4
    end

    subgraph Phase4[Phase 4: Specialized Domains & External]
        direction TB
        Freelance[Freelance & iSaaS]
        Free1[Build Landing & Core Pages]
        Free2[Implement Jobs & Freelancers Browse]
        Free3[Develop Job Management]
        Free4[Setup Contracts & Proposals]
        Freelance --> Free1 --> Free2 --> Free3 --> Free4

        Tools[Tools & WebTools]
        Tool1[Implement Tool Runners]
        Tool2[Build Tools Portal & Licenses]
        Tool3[Develop Utility WebTools]
        Tools --> Tool1 --> Tool2 --> Tool3

        Ext[External Modules & Addons]
        Ext1[Setup External Marketplace]
        Ext2[Implement Booking System]
        Ext3[Develop Affiliate POS]
        Ext4[Build SMS Gateway]
        Ext5[Create GoldSavers]
        Ext --> Ext1 --> Ext2 --> Ext3 --> Ext4 --> Ext5
    end

    Core --> Phase1
    Phase1 --> Phase2
    Phase2 --> Phase3
    Phase3 --> Phase4
